One of a Kind Show, held in April and December each year, can be your best opportunity to sell to tens of thousands of affluent consumers who value handmade work and love to shop!&nbsp; The award-winning show boasts an ideal downtown Chicago location, a premium indoor exhibiting environment, and unparalleled marketing and promotional opportunities. &nbsp;<br />
<br />
Artists, makers and creators of high quality, handmade, original work are invited to apply to be a part of the One of a Kind experience! Eligible work ranges from giftable craft to premium fine art. &nbsp;Applications will be juried and chosen based on uniqueness, craftsmanship, and attention to detail. &nbsp;
